WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.240
Select the Manage option from the home page menu, choose V3 liquidity and then select

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.800
the new lock option, select the LP position you want to lock, note that there are default

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:33.660
and advanced options, specify your lock amount, specify the unlock date, customize your lock

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:44.000
range and fee options if desired, hit the lock button and approve in your wallet, wait

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.380
for a few seconds, select the new V3 lock position NFT to view more details. Withdraw

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:55.500
and edit options are located further down the page.
